### あいさつ
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello

### 保存する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{"examId": "02", "score": 41, "total": 60, "durationSec": 3920}

### 一覧（新しい順）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attempts

### 1件
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attempts/1

### 無い番号 → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attempts/99

### 入力がおかしい → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{"examId": "", "score": -1, "total": 0, "durationSec": 10}